[thin] Derived seal section: the ring's 1 mm is the gap between the display cover plate's underside, 3.84 mm below the display plane, and the glass's front face at 4.84 mm (display-gasket/README.md). The ring fills it so the snap-retained cover bears on the glass through TPU.
alternatives: A thicker ring holds the cover off its snap seat; a thinner one leaves the cover bearing on bare glass or not at all. Either is a change to the cover or the display's mounting, not to this ring.
