[sliver] The ring's own 1 mm edges: the outer edge on the glass's 113.5 × 77 mm outline and the inner edge on the cover plate's 107.5 × 71 mm window, 3 mm apart (display-gasket/README.md). They are the derived 1 mm thickness seen side-on.
alternatives: As for the section: the thickness is set by the cover and glass faces it fills between.
